reagent-name-atropine = Atropine
reagent-desc-atropine = Plant based chemical replaced and superseded by Epinephrine, it has a plethora of side effects but is considerably stronger than epinephrine.
reagent-name-thymol = Thymol
reagent-desc-thymol = Known chemical used in the 20th century as innovative way to combat hookworm parasites and generally all kinds of infections, it was since used as natural pesticide.
reagent-name-psoralen = Psoralen
reagent-desc-psoralen = Naturally occurring carcinogenic, used commonly as mutagen for DNA research.
reagent-name-coniine = Coniine
reagent-desc-coniine = Potent toxic chemical causing loss of consciousness and respiratory failure in matter of seconds, although it was studied for a long time, it could have some undocumented use.
reagent-name-zygacine = Zygacine
reagent-desc-zygacine = Causes convulsing of the heart muscles before blocking the contractions entirely.
reagent-name-digoxin = Digoxin
reagent-desc-digoxin = One of the oldest chemicals to enter field in treating many heart conditions, besides few sides effects, it can be used to great effect.
reagent-name-urishiol = Urishiol
reagent-desc-urishiol = Potent skin and tissue irritant causing burns which lasts weeks after the contact is made, commonly encountered in plants like Poison Ivy, Poison Oak, and similar toxicodendrons.
reagent-name-cyanide = Cyanide
reagent-desc-cyanide = Cyanide is a naturally occurring toxic chemical, that has been used as a mean of killing for centuries because of its immediate effects. Symptoms include nausea, weakness, and difficulty breathing.
reagent-name-phenol-formaldehyde = Phenol-Formaldehyde resin
reagent-desc-phenol-formaldehyde = Phenol-Formaldehyde Resin is a common molding polymer used in production of many small parts. It has great stress capacity and proven itself over many decades.
reagent-name-black-sludge = Black sludge
reagent-desc-black-sludge = A dark sludgy mixture that appears to be nothing but wretched slop.
reagent-name-formaldehyde = Formaldehyde
reagent-desc-formaldehyde = Formaldehyde is a toxic organic gas that is mostly used in making resins, polymers and explosives. It is known to be a natural carcinogen.
reagent-name-ciphertoxin = Ciphertoxin
reagent-desc-ciphertoxin = A strange, sludgy chemical.
reagent-name-botanical-ammonia = Plant-based ammonia
reagent-desc-botanical-ammonia = Ammonia drawn from plant matter. Feeds crops, poisons crew.
reagent-name-botanical-diethylamine = Plant-based diethylamine
reagent-desc-botanical-diethylamine = A potent fertilizer distilled from plant matter.
reagent-name-botanical-unstable-mutagen = Plant-based unstable mutagen
reagent-desc-botanical-unstable-mutagen = A mutagenic compound extracted from mutated flora. Encourages cancerous growths in humans.
reagent-name-botanical-phenol = Plant-based phenol
reagent-desc-botanical-phenol = A plant-derived phenol. Reeks of whiskey and scrambles nerves.
reagent-name-botanical-amatoxin = Plant-based amatoxin
reagent-desc-botanical-amatoxin = A mushroom-derived toxin that taxes the body the longer it lingers.
reagent-name-xeno-blood = Acidic blood
reagent-desc-xeno-blood = A corrosive blood like substance. Makeup appears to be made out of acids and blood plasma.
reagent-name-xeno-royal-blood = Dark acidic blood
reagent-desc-xeno-royal-blood = A corrosive blood like substance. Makeup appears to be made out of acids and blood plasma.
reagent-name-xeno-plasma = Plasma
reagent-desc-xeno-plasma = A clear extracellular fluid separated from blood.
reagent-name-phero-plasma = Pheromone plasma
reagent-desc-phero-plasma = A funny smelling plasma...
reagent-name-chitin-plasma = Chitin plasma
reagent-desc-chitin-plasma = A very thick fibrous plasma...
reagent-name-cat-plasma = Catecholamine plasma
reagent-desc-cat-plasma = A reddish plasma...
reagent-name-egg-plasma = Egg plasma
reagent-desc-egg-plasma = A white-ish plasma high with a high concentration of protein...
reagent-name-neuro-plasma = Neurotoxin plasma
reagent-desc-neuro-plasma = A plasma containing an unknown but potent neurotoxin.
reagent-name-nutrient-plasma = Nutrient plasma
reagent-desc-nutrient-plasma = A turquoise plasma...
reagent-name-purple-plasma = Purple plasma
reagent-desc-purple-plasma = A purplish plasma...
reagent-name-royal-plasma = Royal plasma
reagent-desc-royal-plasma = A dark purplish plasma...

reagent-name-oleoresin-capsicum = Oleoresin capsicum
reagent-desc-oleoresin-capsicum = A concentrated pepper extract used in pepper spray. Extremely painful in the eyes.
reagent-name-capsicum-neutralizer = Capsicum neutralizer
reagent-desc-capsicum-neutralizer = A soothing saline wash that neutralizes pepper spray.

reagent-name-cmu-tear-gas = tear gas
reagent-desc-cmu-tear-gas = A lachrymatory agent. Harmless in a beaker, miserable as a smoke.

# Pathogen fluids  
reagent-name-pathogen-blood = Mycohemolymph  
reagent-desc-pathogen-blood = Thick, pale fluid threaded with hyphal filaments. It is definitely not blood.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-royal-blood = Royal Mycohemolymph  
reagent-desc-pathogen-royal-blood = Golden-tinged circulatory fluid from a higher-order pathogen. It writhes faintly.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-plasma = Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-plasma = A nutrient-rich suspension of spores and cytoplasm, the pathogen's lifeblood.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-phero-plasma = Pheromonal Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-phero-plasma = Sporoplasm saturated with signaling compounds. It smells wrong in a way you can't place.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-chitin-plasma = Chitinous Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-chitin-plasma = Sporoplasm heavy with dissolved chitin platelets, used to knit fungal armor.

reagent-name-pathogen-cat-plasma = Catecholamine Sporoplasm
reagent-desc-pathogen-cat-plasma = Sporoplasm that still seems to twitch with energy, ready to rip apart the closest living thing.
  
reagent-name-pathogen-spore-plasma = Sporogenic Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-spore-plasma = Sporoplasm dense with dormant spore clusters. Handle carefully.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-neuro-plasma = Neural Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-neuro-plasma = Sporoplasm carrying neuroactive alkaloids. Exposure causes fugue-like symptoms.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-mycotoxin-plasma = Mycotoxic Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-mycotoxin-plasma = Virulent sporoplasm. Overdose seeds the host with something that outlives them.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-royal-plasma = Royal Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-royal-plasma = Concentrated sporoplasm from a royal caste. It hums at the edge of hearing.  
  
reagent-name-pathogen-nutrient-plasma = Nutrient Sporoplasm  
reagent-desc-pathogen-nutrient-plasma = Digested organic slurry the pathogen circulates as a food reserve.

reagent-name-weyu-bloodbursting = We-Yu XX-122 Sample
reagent-desc-weyu-bloodbursting = A strange mass of black fungal spores.
  
# Test reagents  
reagent-name-test-bloodbursting-chem = Test Bloodbursting Chem  
reagent-desc-test-bloodbursting-chem = Admin/test reagent. Overdose implants a bloodburster embryo.  
  
reagent-name-test-mycotoxigenic-chem = Test Mycotoxigenic Chem  
reagent-desc-test-mycotoxigenic-chem = Admin/test reagent. Overdose seeds pending walker conversion.
